The '''Rare Short Spiked Wristband''' was initially released as one of the Monthly Member Gifts during July 2011, and is obtainable as a prize in The Forgotten Desert and Tiki Trouble. It is also commonly referred to as 'Rare Short Wrist,' or 'Short Wrist'.

